error[dli::syntax::unterminated-string]: this string is never closed — add the closing ".
  --> line 1:12
  |
1 | place weir "The Weir proposed
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ unclosed string
  |
  = what: a label's quote was opened and never closed, so the words after it are read as part of the label
  = fix:  add the closing `"`
  = rule: a run-on label would swallow the claims after it; closing the quote keeps each claim on its own line, where its blame and origin live  (koan 4 — nothing is silently dropped; 01-syntax.md §2)
